{
  "choice": "record",
  "line": "It’s Tuesday. I’m here again. I’m not calling you, Jo, not yet."
}

{
  "choice": "leave_cart",
  "line": "It's on the desk. Go ahead, press play.\nIt sounds exactly like you want me to sound. Go move your father's couch, Jo."
}

{
  "choice": "keep_carbon",
  "line": "It doesn't sound like *I* want it to sound, Phil. I want a piece that stands on its own, not a recording of my own voice."
}

{
  "choice": "take_case",
  "line": "I’m grabbing the case before you two start screaming. Let's just get this across the street."
}

{
  "choice": "booth",
  "line": "I’m going to stand in the dark for a minute. Do not follow me. Just let me be a guy in a hallway before I have to be a weatherman."
}

{
  "choice": "keep_running",
  "line": "Eight minutes is plenty for a machine to eat a film, so don't ask me to cut it. You two can sit down while I decide if that microphone is worth the weight."
}

{
  "choice": "write_label",
  "line": "It's not the mic, Alma. It's the breath. I'm marking the reel so Phil doesn't skip the part where he forgets his own name."
}

{
  "choice": "draw_chair",
  "line": "Larry, stop marking that reel like it's a warning label, and Alma, if you're done listening to the machine eat itself, tell me what you actually think that breath is for."
}

{
  "choice": "stay_put",
  "line": "Phil forgets his name, not the breath. The breath is just the hole in the wall where the money used to be."
}

{
  "choice": "dial",
  "line": "It's me. I'm not going to stand in the dark anymore, I just need to hear the static for a second. Don't say you're fine, Jo, I don't believe it."
}

{
  "choice": "stay",
  "line": "Phil, I found the buttons. I'm pulling the last leg out now."
}

{
  "choice": "memo",
  "line": "I hear you. I'm just standing here looking at the floor, trying to figure out why I keep doing this to myself."
}

{
  "choice": "leave_space",
  "line": "Don't you dare pick it for me, Larry. Just get the camera set up so we can see what's actually in the room."
}

{
  "choice": "unplug",
  "line": "Fine. It stays dark.\nDon't look at me like I owe you an answer, Rita."
}

{
  "choice": "silence",
  "line": "Fine. Take the slot. I'm done deciding what you two think sounds like a human being."
}

{
  "choice": "leave",
  "line": "It isn't a sound, it's just the air leaving the room. Take my coat, I'm done."
}

{
 "choice": "cut",
 "line": "Don't do that. I mean, just let it run. I can't stand listening to myself sound so... human."
}
